n start referring friends and family with your special link.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">2. How You Earn</span></strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Who is more familiar with BTF-LIGHTING than you, our esteemed customer? You will get a 5% commission on total referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your special coupon code through your affiliate link. </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">3. Get Your Reward</span></strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Once someone makes a purchase using your link, you'll receive an email notification. We'll review the order within 30 days. After verification, you'll get another email with details on how to collect your 5% commission.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">4. Referring Multiple People</span></strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:init